{
	"$comment": "Source of the Code theme (#37). brands/code.css is generated from this file by `npm run tokens:code` (scripts/ci/code-theme.mjs --write); do not edit the CSS by hand. `from` names where a value comes from in stuffcloud's design (design:<file>|<selector>{<property>} in docs/design/prototypes, design:<file>#<text> for a literal in a mockup, app:<file>|... for stuffcloud's web/apps/web/src, ds:<token>@<theme> for the 'Stuffcloud - Designsystem' artifact); `design` is the source value when the kern value is derived from it (a font shorthand split into family and size, a length mapped onto the kern scale). kern owns the theme since #181 and stuffcloud's design is a frozen reference to orient on: a kern decision without a counterpart there is `\"from\": \"kern:#<issue>\"` plus a `note`; a deliberate deviation from the reference keeps its `from`, records the reference value as `design` and adds `\"diverges\": \"kern:#<issue>\"` plus a `note` with the reason. The drift check compares every design `from` with the frozen snapshot in scripts/ci/code-theme-snapshot.json, so an accidental change fails (docs/themes.md, 'Code theme source').",
	"theme": "code",
	"aliases": ["stuffcloud"],
	"header": [
		"Code — oriented on the stuffcloud design (the app that first used it); kern owns it (#181). Grid look: square corners,",
		"hard offset shadows, ink-filled buttons that turn accent on hover.",
		"Fonts: Inter, JetBrains Mono, Silkscreen (load them yourself).",
		"",
		"GENERATED from src/lib/themes/code.tokens.json by `npm run tokens:code`: change that file,",
		"never this one (docs/themes.md, 'Code theme source'). A value there names the place it was oriented on",
		"in stuffcloud's frozen reference (docs/design, the app, or the design-system artifact for light, paper and contrast)",
		"or says in a note why kern decides it itself.",
		"",
		"Sizes: target-min 44px for every target (mouse too), 48px for icon-only buttons, 52px for",
		"fields and buttons, 56px below the 760px breakpoint. The component tokens (--k-button-*,",
		"--k-field-*, --k-tab-*, --k-modal-*, ...) reproduce the look of stuffcloud's components (#38).",
		"",
		"Renamed from \"stuffcloud\" (#85): every rule also answers to the old data-theme values",
		"(stuffcloud, stuffcloud-dark, -light, -paper, -contrast) as deprecated aliases until 1.0."
	],
